WEBVTT

00:00:12.012 --> 00:00:15.473
MISSION 57
"IT'S JUST A SNOWMAN."

00:00:15.974 --> 00:00:20.937
<i>When a person has extreme social anxiety,</i>

00:00:22.147 --> 00:00:25.442
<i>they struggle to communicate with others.</i>

00:00:27.819 --> 00:00:29.654
<i>Bear in mind,</i>

00:00:31.364 --> 00:00:33.742
<i>they only struggle to form connections.</i>

00:00:33.825 --> 00:00:38.163
<i>It doesn't mean they don't want to.</i>

00:00:43.168 --> 00:00:45.045
RUSTLE RUSTLE

00:00:58.975 --> 00:01:00.894
DEAD

00:01:07.150 --> 00:01:09.611
EXCITEMENT

00:01:09.694 --> 00:01:11.863
SNOW!

00:01:13.406 --> 00:01:15.241
LET'S GO PLAY!

00:01:29.881 --> 00:01:31.299
PUSH

00:01:45.647 --> 00:01:47.524
SHIVER

00:02:00.453 --> 00:02:03.832
HUGE

00:02:10.672 --> 00:02:11.506
CRUMBLE

00:02:28.439 --> 00:02:30.316
HELP ME

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:33.778
-NAJIMI MADE IT.
-STARTLE

00:02:39.242 --> 00:02:41.619
FINISHED!

00:03:01.973 --> 00:03:04.851
FROWN

00:03:08.396 --> 00:03:11.274
SMILE

00:03:23.202 --> 00:03:24.412
Yummy!

00:03:24.495 --> 00:03:28.458
Komi! We brought some for you too!

00:03:31.002 --> 00:03:33.504
You know, I found a weird rock
the other day…

00:03:33.588 --> 00:03:34.714
Oh!

00:05:06.055 --> 00:05:07.015
MISSION 58
"IT'S JUST A SNOWBALL FIGHT."

00:05:07.098 --> 00:05:11.352
Who wants to have a snowball fight?

00:05:11.436 --> 00:05:13.271
Yeah!

00:05:13.354 --> 00:05:14.480
<i>So many people came!</i>

00:05:15.398 --> 00:05:16.774
The rules are simple!

00:05:16.858 --> 00:05:19.360
If a snowball hits you
and breaks, you're dead!

00:05:19.444 --> 00:05:20.737
Hit!

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:22.030
If it doesn't break, you're safe!

00:05:22.113 --> 00:05:22.947
Safe.

00:05:23.031 --> 00:05:24.657
FIELD

00:05:24.741 --> 00:05:26.409
The teams will be like this!

00:05:26.492 --> 00:05:31.414
HIGH SCHOOL TEAM
NAJIMI, TADANO, AGARI, YAMAI, YADANO

00:05:31.497 --> 00:05:36.419
ELEMENTARY SCHOOL TEAM
SHIOTA, MICHISATO, SAIKO, OKI, KOMI

00:05:36.502 --> 00:05:40.006
Why is Komi on the elementary school team?

00:05:40.089 --> 00:05:42.508
It's to keep the numbers even! Ha-ha.

00:05:42.592 --> 00:05:44.927
-<i>I feel like there's something more…</i>
-HAVING FUN

00:05:45.011 --> 00:05:47.263
We won't lose to some high schoolers!

00:05:47.346 --> 00:05:49.390
Yeah!

00:05:52.310 --> 00:05:53.352
Huh?

00:05:53.436 --> 00:05:55.855
-<i>What's up with her…</i>
-<i>She doesn't speak at all!</i>

00:05:55.938 --> 00:05:58.983
-<i>She's scary!</i>
-<i>She's messing with our vibe.</i>

00:05:59.484 --> 00:06:00.401
GLOOM

00:06:00.485 --> 00:06:02.361
I-I hope she's okay.

00:06:02.445 --> 00:06:04.113
We're starting!

00:06:13.039 --> 00:06:13.873
BOFF

00:06:13.956 --> 00:06:15.416
Oki!

00:06:16.042 --> 00:06:17.960
<i>Itsuya Oki. Dead.</i>

00:06:18.044 --> 00:06:21.172
Ha-ha! Don't underestimate high schoolers!

00:06:22.256 --> 00:06:25.093
Hey lady! You still have that snowball?

00:06:25.176 --> 00:06:26.094
TREMBLE

00:06:26.177 --> 00:06:28.763
-CAN I REALLY THROW THIS?
-IT MIGHT HURT.

00:06:28.846 --> 00:06:30.306
What's she doing?

00:06:30.389 --> 00:06:31.265
BOFF

00:06:31.349 --> 00:06:32.850
Sacchi!

00:06:33.434 --> 00:06:35.269
<i>Chii Saiko. Dead.</i>

00:06:36.270 --> 00:06:37.230
<i>They're strong.</i>

00:06:37.313 --> 00:06:39.482
-<i>Those two are especially good.</i>
-NAJIMI, YAMAI: STRONG

00:06:39.982 --> 00:06:41.192
<i>Everyone else is average.</i>

00:06:41.275 --> 00:06:44.362
<i>We have three people left.</i>
<i>We have to cooperate!</i>

00:06:44.445 --> 00:06:46.531
Lady, just throw the snowball!

00:06:46.614 --> 00:06:50.618
TREMBLE

00:06:50.701 --> 00:06:52.120
TOO SCARED SO SHE THREW WEAKLY.

00:06:52.203 --> 00:06:53.371
<i>She's useless!</i>

00:06:53.454 --> 00:06:55.581
-BOFF
-Micchi!

00:06:58.126 --> 00:07:01.254
Micchi! Are you okay? Micchi!

00:07:03.798 --> 00:07:05.216
Sho…

00:07:05.299 --> 00:07:08.177
It's alright. Don't speak!

00:07:08.886 --> 00:07:12.390
Sho… Live…

00:07:17.603 --> 00:07:20.314
LAURA MICHISATO
DEAD

00:07:28.865 --> 00:07:30.700
-SPLAT
-JIGGLE

00:07:32.243 --> 00:07:33.286
TADANO HITOHITO, AGARI HIMIKO
DEAD

00:07:33.369 --> 00:07:35.121
A-Alright!

00:07:36.122 --> 00:07:38.749
BOFF

00:07:40.877 --> 00:07:43.212
SHOTA SHIOTA
DEAD

00:07:48.050 --> 00:07:50.720
<i>So we've… lost…</i>

00:07:53.306 --> 00:07:57.018
<i>In the end, we couldn't beat the adults.</i>

00:07:58.102 --> 00:08:00.521
-H-Hey. Look!
-Hm?

00:08:15.995 --> 00:08:18.581
Since when was there only one enemy left?

00:08:22.210 --> 00:08:23.085
<i>Just seconds before.</i>

00:08:32.428 --> 00:08:35.556
No!

00:08:39.352 --> 00:08:42.980
<i>They were aiming at Komi,</i>
<i>so Yamai killed them.</i>

00:08:47.818 --> 00:08:50.363
I did it for you, Komi.

00:08:50.446 --> 00:08:53.658
I killed Najimi and Yadano.

00:08:53.741 --> 00:08:54.784
Okay?

00:09:01.457 --> 00:09:03.626
<i>W-Whoa!</i>

00:09:03.709 --> 00:09:05.836
<i>The elementary school team won.</i>

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:09.840
ELEMENTARY SCHOOLER RELATIONSHIP CHART
LIKE - MORE THAN FRIENDS - LIKE

00:09:09.924 --> 00:09:11.259
MISSION 59
"IT'S JUST THE END OF THE YEAR."

00:09:11.342 --> 00:09:12.343
THE KOMI FAMILY HOME

00:09:12.426 --> 00:09:15.304
Mother! Hello!

00:09:16.305 --> 00:09:18.307
Thank you for another year.

00:09:18.391 --> 00:09:23.062
Please keep us in your care
for the year to come.

00:09:24.814 --> 00:09:26.816
-Yay!
-POKE POKE

00:09:26.899 --> 00:09:28.776
Oh my!

00:09:28.859 --> 00:09:30.570
Shuko, you're here!

00:09:31.320 --> 00:09:32.321
Ryoko!

00:09:32.405 --> 00:09:34.156
-<i>Déjà vu.</i>
-Your hair looks great!

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:35.741
Thanks!

00:09:35.825 --> 00:09:38.536
-I haven't seen you since summer holidays!
-Yeah!

00:09:38.619 --> 00:09:41.914
My first summer break since I turned 17!

00:09:41.998 --> 00:09:42.832
Hey now.

00:09:42.915 --> 00:09:45.126
What? Is that Shoko?

00:09:45.876 --> 00:09:49.797
You get prettier and prettier
every time I see you.

00:09:49.880 --> 00:09:51.257
<i>Déjà vu.</i>

00:09:51.340 --> 00:09:56.470
And Shosuke. You're handsomer than ever!

00:09:56.554 --> 00:09:58.681
Shosuke!

00:10:02.727 --> 00:10:05.187
COUSIN: AKIRA

00:10:09.775 --> 00:10:10.610
DASH

00:10:21.245 --> 00:10:22.455
BOO

00:10:23.539 --> 00:10:24.373
THUD THUD

00:10:25.625 --> 00:10:29.712
And then Ms. Aoyama stopped
the potter's wheel…

00:10:30.504 --> 00:10:32.381
DIDN'T THINK SHE'D BE SO SURPRISED.

00:10:32.465 --> 00:10:33.299
THUD THUD

00:10:33.883 --> 00:10:37.845
Wow! But I suppose I would do the same.

00:10:40.973 --> 00:10:42.391
Don't fall!

00:10:43.017 --> 00:10:44.518
They get along well.

00:10:44.602 --> 00:10:46.479
<i>They've started having fun.</i>

00:10:50.066 --> 00:10:52.693
<i>The emotional distance</i>
<i>between them has shrunk.</i>

00:10:55.237 --> 00:10:56.906
S-Shoko!

00:10:56.989 --> 00:10:58.366
Hanafuda!

00:10:58.449 --> 00:10:59.909
Let's play Hanafuda!

00:11:04.914 --> 00:11:07.333
SUDDEN DESPAIR

00:11:09.335 --> 00:11:12.588
Oh. Akira always cries when she's happy.

00:11:19.136 --> 00:11:21.972
We'll play <i>Koi-koi</i>.
The simplest rules. Okay?

00:11:22.056 --> 00:11:23.307
Shoko, do you know how to play?

00:11:23.391 --> 00:11:24.517
SHAKES HEAD

00:11:24.600 --> 00:11:26.310
I'll explain.

00:11:26.394 --> 00:11:28.896
The ones with a ribbon are slips.

00:11:28.979 --> 00:11:31.440
Ten dregs are worth one point.

00:11:32.691 --> 00:11:36.904
And one extra point
for each dreg after that…

00:11:39.407 --> 00:11:41.575
Oh Grandma, do you want to play too?

00:11:46.914 --> 00:11:48.416
I'll play too.

00:11:48.958 --> 00:11:52.044
-Alright, Grandma and I will show you how.
-SHOCKED BY GRANDMA.

00:11:52.128 --> 00:11:54.588
Shoko, you can watch.

00:11:54.672 --> 00:11:58.175
We'll play six rounds.
With Cup Cherry and Cup Moon.

00:11:58.259 --> 00:12:03.139
One point is a hundred yen.
Winnings go to your New Year's gift money.

00:12:03.222 --> 00:12:06.267
But if you lose,
I'll take it out of your gift money.

00:12:06.767 --> 00:12:09.019
I'll let you deal, Akira.

00:12:12.022 --> 00:12:13.357
Yeah?

00:12:14.817 --> 00:12:16.152
YUIKO VS AKIRA

00:12:16.235 --> 00:12:21.157
<i>This is how the Grandma Yuiko vs. Akira</i>
<i>Hanafuda Battle began.</i>

00:12:22.992 --> 00:12:24.952
<i>First up, Akira.</i>

00:12:25.453 --> 00:12:28.497
<i>She uses the Cherry Dreg to pick up</i>
<i>the Cherry Curtain from the field.</i>

00:12:28.581 --> 00:12:30.374
<i>A sensible move.</i>

00:12:31.125 --> 00:12:32.501
<i>She drew…</i>

00:12:32.585 --> 00:12:35.838
<i>Pine with Red Slip.</i>
<i>There's no Pine in the field.</i>

00:12:36.422 --> 00:12:39.008
<i>Yuiko is next. She chooses…</i>

00:12:39.633 --> 00:12:41.093
<i>Pampas Moon.</i>

00:12:41.594 --> 00:12:44.847
-<i>Her opponent takes a Bright card.</i>
-BRIGHT: VALUABLE, 5 IN TOTAL

00:12:45.431 --> 00:12:48.851
<i>But in Akira's hand, there's already…</i>

00:12:49.518 --> 00:12:51.520
-<i>The Chrysanthemum Cup card.</i>
-CUP & CHERRY BRIGHT: 5 POINTS

00:12:53.063 --> 00:12:54.565
<i>A fearless smile.</i>

00:12:55.065 --> 00:12:58.194
<i>But there still isn't</i>
<i>a Chrysanthemum card in the field.</i>

00:12:58.277 --> 00:13:01.530
<i>Akira collects the Peony and Butterfly.</i>

00:13:02.615 --> 00:13:05.493
<i>The card from the deck,</i>
<i>is Plum and Bush Warbler.</i>

00:13:06.076 --> 00:13:08.454
<i>She takes the Plum and Red Slip</i>

00:13:08.537 --> 00:13:09.371
AKIRA'S HAND

00:13:09.455 --> 00:13:10.414
<i>A good start!</i>

00:13:10.915 --> 00:13:12.416
<i>A very good start!</i>

00:13:14.335 --> 00:13:15.503
<i>And then…</i>

00:13:16.712 --> 00:13:18.130
<i>There! The Chrysanthemum card!</i>

00:13:21.175 --> 00:13:23.594
<i>She plays the Chrysanthemum Cup.</i>

00:13:23.677 --> 00:13:24.929
<i>She already got a combo!</i>

00:13:25.012 --> 00:13:27.890
<i>Cup Cherry for 5 points.</i>

00:13:27.973 --> 00:13:30.226
<i>It's enough to call the game.</i>

00:13:30.309 --> 00:13:32.853
<i>But Akira chose…</i>

00:13:33.437 --> 00:13:34.313
<i>Koi-koi.</i>

00:13:34.396 --> 00:13:35.981
<i>…to continue playing!</i>

00:13:36.482 --> 00:13:39.485
<i>Akira decided she could still squeeze</i>
<i>more out of her grandmother.</i>

00:13:39.568 --> 00:13:40.778
<i>Gambler's intuition!</i>

00:13:40.861 --> 00:13:43.030
<i>Here's an explanation of the rules!</i>

00:13:43.113 --> 00:13:47.076
<i>After making a combo, the player</i>
<i>can choose to stop or keep going.</i>

00:13:47.159 --> 00:13:47.993
<i>Koi-koi</i>!

00:13:48.077 --> 00:13:51.747
Koi-koi<i> means, "I can still make combos!</i>
<i>I'll make more money!"</i>

00:13:51.830 --> 00:13:53.582
<i>A declaration of intent.</i>

00:13:54.542 --> 00:13:56.919
I'll take Paulownia and Phoenix.

00:13:57.002 --> 00:13:59.129
-Now I've got Three Brights.
-3 BRIGHTS: 6 POINTS

00:14:00.172 --> 00:14:01.423
I'm done.

00:14:01.507 --> 00:14:04.677
<i>Defeat! A sudden defeat!</i>

00:14:04.760 --> 00:14:08.931
<i>Akira was too confident. She didn't watch</i>
<i>which cards her opponent took.</i>

00:14:09.014 --> 00:14:10.641
<i>Typical pride.</i>

00:14:10.724 --> 00:14:14.061
<i>I let my guard down. But that's not all.</i>

00:14:14.144 --> 00:14:16.272
<i>What's amazing is Grandma's power!</i>

00:14:16.355 --> 00:14:18.941
<i>The best hand, Three Brights!</i>

00:14:19.024 --> 00:14:21.610
<i>Five hands to go. This'll be interesting.</i>

00:14:22.653 --> 00:14:25.573
<i>Akira lost by 34 points.</i>

00:14:25.656 --> 00:14:28.701
<i>New years gift money, minus 3,400 yen.</i>

00:14:29.201 --> 00:14:30.953
Shoko, do you want to play?

00:14:31.912 --> 00:14:33.539
…ko…

00:14:33.622 --> 00:14:36.333
Shoko…

00:14:37.293 --> 00:14:40.504
Avenge me!

00:14:41.589 --> 00:14:42.464
Right.

00:14:42.548 --> 00:14:43.549
SHUFFLE SHUFFLE

00:14:43.632 --> 00:14:48.554
If you can get even one point,
I'll cancel Akira's losses.

00:14:49.054 --> 00:14:50.931
-Shoko!
-ELATED

00:14:51.015 --> 00:14:52.641
<i>Her aura says she has no choice.</i>

00:14:53.976 --> 00:14:56.520
<i>Now, Komi vs. Grandma Yuiko.</i>

00:14:56.604 --> 00:14:59.523
<i>Their Hanafuda </i>Koi-koi<i> competition began.</i>

00:15:00.649 --> 00:15:02.234
<i>Komi first.</i>

00:15:02.776 --> 00:15:06.780
Just try to collect cards
with fancy pictures.

00:15:09.533 --> 00:15:13.203
<i>_No, Shoko. That is a fancy card but…</i>

00:15:13.287 --> 00:15:14.914
-<i>It's the Rain Bright!</i>
-3 BRIGHTS - RAIN BRIGHT

00:15:14.997 --> 00:15:17.917
<i>It takes away one point from the Brights!</i>

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:21.378
<i>You should have taken the Cherry Curtain!</i>

00:15:21.462 --> 00:15:22.671
Sho…

00:15:24.340 --> 00:15:25.633
No talking!

00:15:39.063 --> 00:15:41.941
Shoko, you got the Four Rain Brights.

00:15:42.024 --> 00:15:43.651
Want to call <i>koi-koi</i>?

00:15:43.734 --> 00:15:46.403
-<i>Four Brights with Rain? Wow, Shoko!</i>
-FOUR BRIGHTS WITH RAIN: 8 POINTS

00:15:46.487 --> 00:15:50.115
<i>But Grandma only needs one more slip</i>
<i>to make a combo!</i>

00:15:50.199 --> 00:15:52.993
<i>You should call it!</i>

00:15:53.661 --> 00:15:55.788
Will you do it? <i>Koi-koi</i>.

00:15:55.871 --> 00:15:57.247
NOD

00:15:57.331 --> 00:15:59.959
DOESN'T REALLY GET IT.

00:16:00.042 --> 00:16:03.837
<i>No, Shoko! You'll never win that way!</i>

00:16:03.921 --> 00:16:06.674
<i>If you lose after calling koi-koi</i>
<i>you get double points taken off!</i>

00:16:06.757 --> 00:16:10.135
Shoko!

00:16:13.138 --> 00:16:15.641
-Shoko, you got Five Brights.
-5 BRIGHTS: 15 POINTS BEST, POSSIBLE COMBO

00:16:16.141 --> 00:16:18.060
Hmph. You win.

00:16:18.143 --> 00:16:22.439
S-Shoko!

00:16:22.523 --> 00:16:23.607
SHINE

00:16:23.691 --> 00:16:25.985
<i>Komi was surrounded by a bright halo.</i>

00:16:30.072 --> 00:16:32.449
MISSION 60
"IT'S JUST NEW YEAR'S."

00:16:32.533 --> 00:16:36.286
Happy New Year.

00:16:41.208 --> 00:16:43.711
Let's go to the shrine.

00:16:53.220 --> 00:16:55.097
BORROWED IT FROM GRANDMA

00:16:56.181 --> 00:16:58.392
It looks very nice on you.

00:17:00.144 --> 00:17:01.520
Look, look!

00:17:05.816 --> 00:17:07.943
-My dad bought it for me!
-YAY!

00:17:08.527 --> 00:17:10.779
What a wonderful gift.

00:17:18.495 --> 00:17:20.873
-I've still got it, haven't I?
-SPARKLE

00:17:23.584 --> 00:17:24.835
Mother?

00:17:36.889 --> 00:17:38.140
That's convenient.

00:17:44.104 --> 00:17:47.024
BOW TWICE

00:17:47.107 --> 00:17:48.984
CLAP TWICE

00:17:50.527 --> 00:17:51.570
Shoko.

00:17:52.446 --> 00:17:56.325
Did your wish from last year come true?

00:18:01.747 --> 00:18:03.165
Is that so.

00:18:03.665 --> 00:18:07.086
Then, you've got to give thanks.

00:18:16.261 --> 00:18:18.680
BOW ONCE

00:18:18.764 --> 00:18:21.642
Let's say hello at the shrine office.

00:18:23.143 --> 00:18:27.356
G-God has come to Earth!

00:18:27.439 --> 00:18:30.567
-<i>Everyone started their year well.</i>
-SHRINE VISITORS

00:18:31.568 --> 00:18:32.778
Pardon me.

00:18:32.861 --> 00:18:35.239
Oh, Yuiko. Excellent timing!

00:18:35.322 --> 00:18:38.700
-One of my staff is out with a cold.
-HEAD PRIEST (63)

00:18:38.784 --> 00:18:41.703
We're very busy. What should I do, Yuiko?

00:18:41.787 --> 00:18:42.830
Oh.

00:18:49.920 --> 00:18:52.965
It'll be a good experience. Go on.

00:18:54.466 --> 00:18:56.844
Thank you very much!

00:18:56.927 --> 00:19:00.180
Noko, here's our temporary replacement.

00:19:00.264 --> 00:19:02.057
Show her how to do it, okay?

00:19:02.641 --> 00:19:03.767
Alright!

00:19:05.352 --> 00:19:07.229
Okay, come over here.

00:19:08.272 --> 00:19:11.525
Basically we add up
the prices of the charms.

00:19:11.608 --> 00:19:14.862
Just look at this chart
and take the money.

00:19:14.945 --> 00:19:17.781
Are you cold? Use this heater.

00:19:17.865 --> 00:19:21.451
I'm used to it, so don't worry.

00:19:23.996 --> 00:19:26.707
-<i>It's Komi!</i>
-NOTE: INAKA HAS A SECRET

00:19:26.790 --> 00:19:30.669
<i>M-My secret! She knows</i>
<i>I'm a country bumpkin now!</i>

00:19:30.752 --> 00:19:34.673
-<i>I-I'll be persecuted!</i>
-PLEASE DON'T THROW POTATOES AT ME

00:19:34.756 --> 00:19:38.260
-<i>I can't go to school!</i>
-BUMPKIN! HICK!

00:19:38.343 --> 00:19:42.014
<i>If she says, "Inaka?", I'll just say</i>

00:19:42.514 --> 00:19:43.765
"Must be my doppelganger."

00:19:43.849 --> 00:19:46.226
That's cool! I'll go with that.

00:19:52.316 --> 00:19:54.359
HER SOCIAL ANXIETY
PREVENTS HER FROM ASKING

00:19:54.443 --> 00:19:56.195
<i>Could it be…</i>

00:19:57.029 --> 00:19:58.071
<i>she didn't notice?</i>

00:19:59.072 --> 00:20:00.574
<i>What a relief.</i>

00:20:00.657 --> 00:20:02.910
<i>As long as she doesn't know.</i>

00:20:02.993 --> 00:20:04.620
<i>I'll just stay quiet.</i>

00:20:04.703 --> 00:20:08.081
<i>I'll get through this</i>
<i>by not showing my face.</i>

00:20:08.624 --> 00:20:12.252
<i>But why is Komi in my little town?</i>

00:20:12.753 --> 00:20:15.047
<i>Isn't she a city girl?</i>

00:20:15.130 --> 00:20:17.299
-<i>But Komi surely…</i>
-EFFICIENT

00:20:17.382 --> 00:20:20.719
<i>I'm sure she can do any job</i>
<i>with speed and efficiency.</i>

00:20:20.802 --> 00:20:23.263
<i>Of course. She's Komi after all.</i>

00:20:23.347 --> 00:20:26.475
A lucky arrow, a big paper amulet,
safe birth, and traffic safety.

00:20:26.558 --> 00:20:28.435
Two big and one small daruma.

00:20:28.518 --> 00:20:29.436
<i>Komi?!</i>

00:20:29.519 --> 00:20:31.438
-TREMBLING
-<i>I have to help her!</i>

00:20:31.521 --> 00:20:34.399
<i>But if I talk to her,</i>
<i>she might figure out my secret!</i>

00:20:37.861 --> 00:20:39.363
AMULET PRICE LIST

00:20:43.867 --> 00:20:45.244
It's okay.

00:20:46.036 --> 00:20:48.080
You can write it down.

00:20:51.583 --> 00:20:52.584
Alright?

00:20:59.508 --> 00:21:00.425
TOTAL: 6,000 YEN

00:21:00.509 --> 00:21:02.261
Oh, okay.

00:21:02.344 --> 00:21:03.387
<i>Why did she write it down?</i>

00:21:07.015 --> 00:21:09.476
Well done!

00:21:09.559 --> 00:21:11.270
Thanks for the help!

00:21:11.353 --> 00:21:14.273
Some other girls
are coming in for their shift now.

00:21:14.356 --> 00:21:15.440
Thanks.

00:21:17.067 --> 00:21:19.278
<i>Work is done.</i>

00:21:19.945 --> 00:21:21.905
<i>And I'm done too!</i>

00:21:24.908 --> 00:21:29.454
THANK YOU FOR TODAY, INAKA.

00:21:29.538 --> 00:21:31.623
<i>S-She did figure it out!</i>

00:21:33.959 --> 00:21:40.340
ALSO, HAPPY NEW YEAR.
LET'S HAVE A GREAT YEAR.

00:21:46.722 --> 00:21:48.265
And the same to you.

00:21:49.141 --> 00:21:52.436
Best wishes for the new year.

00:21:53.103 --> 00:21:55.522
BONUS SCENE

00:21:55.605 --> 00:21:59.109
-AFTER THE SNOWBALL FIGHT
-High school lady, you're pretty cool!

00:21:59.192 --> 00:22:00.652
The silent killer!

00:22:00.736 --> 00:22:02.946
A single flower
blooming on the battlefield!

00:22:04.990 --> 00:22:07.034
JERK! TWITCH!

00:22:07.117 --> 00:22:10.912
<i>Komi had always wanted to do that</i>
<i>"humble scratch" move. (It didn't work.)</i>

00:22:10.996 --> 00:22:12.831
<i>She still doesn't say a word.</i>

00:22:12.914 --> 00:22:15.042
-<i>So awesome!</i>
-<i>A cool beauty!</i>

00:22:15.125 --> 00:22:17.544
<i>I want to be a lady like her</i>
<i>when I grow up!</i>

00:22:17.627 --> 00:22:18.462
<i>Me too!</i>

00:22:18.545 --> 00:22:20.922
-I don't think you can.
-Heh.

00:22:24.426 --> 00:22:28.055
-<i>81 more friends until she reaches 100</i>.
-81 TO GO

00:23:59.020 --> 00:24:02.023
Subtitle translation by: Claire Tanaka
